{"id":"039a75104e19f6d2","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing12-countably-closed-factor.md","title":"ZFC Forcing12 Countably Closed Factor","display":"df-zfc-forcing12-countably-closed-factor — ZFC Forcing12 Countably Closed Factor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-countably-closed-factor","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing12-countably-closed-factor"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing12-countably-closed-factor — ZFC Forcing12 Countably Closed Factor","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-countably-closed-factor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-countably-closed-factor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing12-countably-closed-factor — ZFC Forcing12 Countably Closed Factor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,P,X,G,s,q,n,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(Q,P,X,G,s,q,n,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12CountablyClosedFactor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12CountablyClosedFactor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}countably\\text{-}closed\\text{-}factor} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12CountablyClosedFactor}_S(Q,P,G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(P=\\langle X,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(X,\\leq_P)\\land G\\subseteq X\\land G\\neq\\varnothing\\land \\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\land \\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in X\\;(p\\leq_Pq\\to q\\in G)\\land Q=\\{q\\in X\\mid\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in X\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\land r\\leq_Pg)\\}\\land\\forall s\\in Q^\\omega\\;\\left(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(s(n+1)\\leq_Ps(n))\\to\\exists q\\in Q\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(q\\leq_Ps(n))\\right)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}countably\\text{-}closed\\text{-}factor} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12CountablyClosedFactor}_S(Q,P,G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(P=\\langle X,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(X,\\leq_P)\\land G\\subseteq X\\land G\\neq\\varnothing\\land \\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\land \\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in X\\;(p\\leq_Pq\\to q\\in G)\\land Q=\\{q\\in X\\mid\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in X\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\land r\\leq_Pg)\\}\\land\\forall s\\in Q^\\omega\\;\\left(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(s(n+1)\\leq_Ps(n))\\to\\exists q\\in Q\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(q\\leq_Ps(n))\\right)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The factor carrier is no longer an arbitrary subset: it is exactly the conditions compatible with every member of the filter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, and this induced order is required to be countably closed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q,P,X,G,s,q,n,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12CountablyClosedFactor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}countably\\text{-}closed\\text{-}factor} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12CountablyClosedFactor}_S(Q,P,G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(P=\\langle X,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(X,\\leq_P)\\land G\\subseteq X\\land G\\neq\\varnothing\\land \\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\land \\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in X\\;(p\\leq_Pq\\to q\\in G)\\land Q=\\{q\\in X\\mid\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in X\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\land r\\leq_Pg)\\}\\land\\forall s\\in Q^\\omega\\;\\left(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(s(n+1)\\leq_Ps(n))\\to\\exists q\\in Q\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(q\\leq_Ps(n))\\right)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1482,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2039","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing12-countably-closed-factor.md|58-df-zfc-forcing12-countably-closed-factor]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}